   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h2> Turn Options into the Future </h2>",
   "body": "<p>Every »venturion« represents a commitment to the future. It plays a significant role in realizing the vision of highly efficient manufacturing. You’ll be ready to meet the most demanding requirements for measurement and adjusting tools.</p> <p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"https://myzoller.com/de/de/shop/venturion-450-pilot40-de\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Buy Now</a> <a class=\"btn\" href=\"https://myzoller.com/de/de/expert/booking/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">1:1 Expert Consultation</a></p>",
