   },
   "spots": [
    {
     "x": 48.934,
     "y": 18.556,
     "label": "IPC with a 24-inch TFT color monitor",
     "text": "<h3>IPC with a 24-inch TFT color monitor</h3> <h4>IPC with a 24-inch TFT color monitor</h4> <p>Specialized to quickly process large amounts of data and immediately call up extensive programs and measurement sequences. The monitor delivers a crystal-clear representation.</p>"
    },
    {
     "x": 65.542,
     "y": 41.444,
     "label": "Separate control unit »﻿﻿﻿﻿»cockpit«﻿﻿﻿﻿«",
     "text": "<h3>Separate control unit »﻿﻿﻿﻿»cockpit«﻿﻿﻿﻿«</h3> <h4>Separate Control Unit »﻿﻿﻿﻿»cockpit«﻿﻿﻿﻿«</h4> <p>Provides space for a keyboard and mouse, as well as storage for tools, a printer, and a scanner. The monitor is adjustable for height and inclination. The workplace is adjustable in just a few simple steps for comfortable working.</p>"
    },
    {
     "x": 43.606,
     "y": 47.556,
     "label": "Main body along the Z-axis and X-axis",
     "text": "<h3>Main body along the Z-axis and X-axis</h3> <h4>Main body on the Z-axis and the X-axis</h4> <p>Manufactured from a light-metal alloy specialized for measuring machines. Designed to record the weight and forces of the tools. Ensures long-term stability and precision for reliable measurement processes.</p>"
    },
    {
     "x": 10.036,
     "y": 62.333,
     "label": "Bosch/Festo Pneumatics Components",
     "text": "<h3>Bosch/Festo Pneumatics Components</h3> <h4>Bosch/Festo Pneumatics Components</h4> <p>For the safe operation of pneumatic functions, such as the power clamping functions on the spindle.</p>"
    },
    {
     "x": 3.908,
     "y": 82.222,
     "label": "Sturdy equipment base",
     "text": "<h3>Sturdy equipment base</h3> <h4>Sturdy Equipment Base</h4> <p>The base of the device: This is where the computer, pneumatic elements, and electronics are housed, with sufficient space provided for easy accessibility and optimal ventilation. This makes it effective to prevent the computer from overheating, allowing the system to run 24 hours a day.</p>"
    }
