  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h2> Automated Measurement </h2>",
   "body": "<p class=\"large-text\">You’ll always receive precise measurement data for your tools, regardless of how they are used. </p> <p class=\"large-text\">With CN control, autofocus, and the intuitive »pilot 4.0« software, »venturion« brings automated tool measurement to your production facility.</p>",
