  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h2> »ace« Spindle: Quick Exchanges </h2>",
   "body": "<p class=\"large-text\">The »ace« spindle directly mounts any adapter tool post via its ball bushing with zero backlash. You can use the appropriate tool holders in the adapter tool posts and clamp them using a power-operated mechanism, just as in a machine tool. The tool holder exchange takes 10 seconds with an accuracy of &lt; 1 µm. The ROD rotation sensor enters the exact position of the C axis.</p>",
