  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h2> Change what's holding you back from success </h2>",
   "body": "<p>Your production facility is equipped with top-of-the-line machines, and your team is highly qualified and motivated. What’s missing is comprehensive geometry data for your tools and faster machine setup processes. It’s time to shape the future. It’s time for »venturion«.</p> <p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"https://myzoller.com/de/de/shop/venturion-450-pilot40-de\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Buy Now:</a> <a class=\"btn\" href=\"https://myzoller.com/de/de/expert/booking/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">1-on-1 Expert Consultation</a></p>",
